Subject: [PATCH 15/23] =?UTF-8?q?BlueOS:=20Launcher3:=20chibis=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20own=20acts,=20words=20in=20a=20bubble,=20shy=20tap,=20shake?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20and=20drop?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- acts: her gesture (Public), victory pose, callsign, EX skill, the band's
  instruments — something of her own for nearly every model
- her words over her head while a line plays (lines.json from the wiki,
  ru/en/ja, blueos_chibi_lang); the bubble follows her or stays put
  (blueos_bubble_follow)
- the emotes and words in a sub-window over the SurfaceView (were hidden)
- a tap makes her shy (café reaction, blush); a dropped phone makes her fall;
  shaking makes her dizzy and throws them around the screen (blueos_chibi_toss)
- only the chosen chibis load (blueos_chibi_shown: first 3 until picked, max 5)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Id43ecccd0ee2f84389501130515d825d3ccb492f
